OL,3,GNEWSASchool hoped to be built in 2020
OL,4,Adelayed again
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a secondary school on a
OL,7,Fnew housing development have been
OL,8,Fdelayed again, after the school was
OL,9,Foriginally pencilled to open in 2020.
OL,11,FThe wait for Darwin Green Academy in
OL,12,FCambridge has left some other schools
OL,13,Fin the city having to over-admit
OL,14,Fpupils.
OL,16,FParents were told earlier this year a
OL,17,Fplanning application would be made in
OL,18,FAugust, but that has not materialised.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
