OL,3,GNEWSASchool hoped to be built in 2020
OL,4,Adelayed again
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridgeshire County Council said
OL,7,Fthere had been recent "significant
OL,8,Fchanges" to how the school would be
OL,9,Fconnected to utilities. Developer
OL,10,FBarratt and David Wilson Homes South
OL,11,FMidlands said it was working closely
OL,12,Fwith the the council.
